 was pregnant again, this time with Sarah. She moved to Paris, to 5 rue de l'École-de-Médecine ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Bernhardt\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d93\"},\"ref\":\"d93\",\"snippet\":\" ... Such contemporary expressions are interrogated in Finnish director Aki Kaurismäki's 2011 French language film Le Havre, which engages dystopian tropes and conventions, spatialising multiple temporalities to historicise contemporary questions about migration. Le Havre tells the story of teenager Idrissa, who evades police after arriving in the city ... \",\"title\":\"https://c21.openlibhums.org/article/id/9350/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d94\"},\"ref\":\"d94\",\"snippet\":\" ... He joined Le Havre in 2010, turning down offers from leading French teams Paris Saint-Germain and Marseille to join them, being enticed by Le Havre's youth system. He initially played for their reserve team, Le Havre II, before going on to play 60 times and score ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riyad_Mahrez\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d95\"},\"ref\":\"d95\",\"snippet\":\" ... Industry and trade at the Port of Le Havre\\n\\nAlthough Impression, Sunrise was neither Monet's first, nor his only painting to feature Le Havre, it captures a period of growth for the port, indicative of France's participation in global trade and commerce. In the 18th century ... \",\"title\":\"https://smarthistory.org/claude-monets-impression-sunrise/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"